      "@type": "Claim",
      "name": "Entry 8: a closed form for ε from route geometry",
      "text": "ε is predictable from grade alone on real descents: ε ≈ clamp01(min(1, (α/β)/s̄) − 0.13), the −0.13 a near-constant offset for residual descent pedalling/braking; the remaining scatter is rider behaviour, not route geometry.",
